(text "BATTERY: protected 1S LiPo, >=500mAh, 4.2V charging; 10k NTC required.\nJ2 pins 1=BAT+, 2=GND, 3=NTC. THIS IS A CUSTOM 3-PIN PINOUT.\nNo battery supplied or soldered. Missing NTC inhibits charging." (at 25 225 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "b5eae549-50e1-5759-9a63-6d69e06817a1"))
(text "VBAT approximately 2 * BAT_ADC; divider buffered by U9.\nVBUS_ADC is presence detection, not precision voltage measurement.\nUSB_500_EN / USB_SUSPEND_EN: 00=100mA,10=500mA,11=suspend." (at 235 210 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "05d13386-a9f7-5dea-b09a-7121683d6537"))
